{title: 024 - Every Star Shall Sing a Carol}
{artist: Seventh-day Adventist Hymnal}
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: Gm}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{tag: Worship}
{tag: }

Verse 1:
[Gm]Every [Cm]star shall [F]sing a[Bb]carol;
[Gm]Every creature, [Cm]high [Dm]or [Gm]low,
[Bb]Come and [Cm]praise the [F]King of [Bb]heaven
[Gm]By whatever [Cm]name [Dm]you [Gm]know.
[Gm]God a[Dm7]bove, [Gm]Man [Dm7]below,
[Gm]Holy [Cm]is the [Dm7]name I[Gm]know.

Refrain:
[Gm]God [Cm]above, [F]Man [Bb]below,
[Gm]Holy [Cm]is the [Dm]name [Gm]I know.

Verse 2:
[Gm]When [Cm]the King [F]of [Bb]all creation
[Gm]Had [Cm]a cradle [Dm]on [Gm]the earth,
[Bb]Holy [Cm]was [F]the [Bb]human body,
[Gm]Holy [Cm]was [Dm]the [Gm]human birth.

Verse 3:
[Gm]Every [Cm]star [F]and [Bb]every planet,
[Gm]Every [Cm]creature, [Dm]high [Gm]or low,
[Bb]Come [Cm]and praise [F]the King [Bb]of heaven
[Gm]By [Cm]whatever [Dm]name [Gm]you know.
